  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p>礼物价格：1、5、99、520钻</p><p>上新时间：3.2-3.31</p><p>上线位置：推荐墙第二页</p><p>礼物类型：基础礼物</p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p>玩法礼物：99钻、520钻</p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 32.1494%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 21.2221%;\" /><col style=\"width: 36.8895%;\" /><col style=\"width: 41.8745%;\" /></colgroup><tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\">礼物价格</th><td scope=\"col\">99</td><td scope=\"col\">520</td></tr><tr><th>礼物名称</th><td><span>流光少女</span></td><td>&nbsp;<span>冰冕之下</span></td></tr><tr><th>任务时间</th><td>3.2-3.31</td><td>3.2-3.31</td></tr><tr><th>总轮次</th><td>1次不循环</td><td>1次不循环</td></tr><tr><th>统计直播间类型</th><td>普通、公共、四人、六人、九人</td><td>普通、公共、四人、六人、九人</td></tr><tr><th>档位1</th><td>990钻（10个）</td><td>1040钻（2个）</td></tr><tr><th><br /></th><td><span>流光少女</span>头像框*1天</td><td><span>冰冕之下</span>主页挂件*1天</td></tr><tr><th>资源id</th><td><span style=\"color: rgb(96,98,102);\">7211</span></td><td><span style=\"color: rgb(96,98,102);\">6085</span></td></tr><tr><th>档位2</th><td>1980钻（20个）</td><td>2600钻（5个）</td></tr><tr><th><br /></th><td><span>流光少女</span>头像框*1天</td><td><span>冰冕之下</span>主页挂件*1天</td></tr><tr><th>档位3</th><td>2970钻（30个）</td><td>5200钻（10个）</td></tr><tr><th><br /></th><td><span>流光少女</span>头像框*1天</td><td><span>冰冕之下</span>主页挂件*2天</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Hi all，</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">【3月基础礼物上新】将于2.28日进入测试阶段，现申请相关资源礼物配置及上新申请。</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">辛苦@叶导 审批，&nbsp;</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">辛苦@灿灿配置并返回相关id。<br /></span></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">具体需求如下：</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">1、 礼物配置：</span></p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 58.8079%;\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 13.9558%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 6.8995%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 7.99715%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 4.6258%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 32.9294%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 3.99857%;\" /><col style=\"width: 29.5535%;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"5\">基础礼物，推荐墙第二页第三页</td><td>名称</td><td>礼物价格</td><td>id</td><td>url</td><td>备注</td><td>礼物说明</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>雪绒花</td><td>2</td><td>24063</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MjI2MTkxMjI0OCM2NTMjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MjI2MTkxMjI0OCM2NTMjcG5n.png</a></td><td>新</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>一念莲白</td><td>10</td><td>24064</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MjI2MTkzOTEyNCMyNDcjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MjI2MTkzOTEyNCMyNDcjcG5n.png</a></td><td>新</td><td><br /></td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>流光少女</td><td>99</td><td>24065</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MjI2MTk2ODU5NiM1NDMjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MjI2MTk2ODU5NiM1NDMjcG5n.png</a></td><td>新</td><td>【流光少女】首次送出30个，得流光少女头像框*3天</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>冰冕之下</td><td>520</td><td>24066</td><td><a href=\"https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MjI2MTk5ODE2OCM1NTYjcG5n.png\">https://img.ikstatic.cn/MTc3MjI2MTk5ODE2OCM1NTYjcG5n.png</a></td><td>新</td><td>【冰冕之下】首次送出10个，得冰冕之下主页挂件*4天</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">2、资源配置</span></p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 26.823%;\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 36.1385%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 23.404%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 12.5624%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 6.36726%;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 21.511%;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td rowspan=\"3\">资源</td><td>名称</td><td>id</td><td>url</td><td>备注</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>流光少女头像框</td><td>7211</td><td><br /></td><td>改名</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>冰冕之下主页挂件</td><td>6085</td><td><br /></td><td>改名</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\">3、上线配置</p><p>上新时间：<span>2026年3月2日00:00:00-3月31日23:59:59</span></p><p>上线位置：推荐墙第二页</p><p>上新气泡：</p><p><span>气泡类型：默认<br />定位礼物：雪绒花<br />生效场景：所有<br />生效人群：all<br />生效批次：首次<br />生效时间：2026年3月2日00:00:00-3月31日23:59:59<br />优先级：1</span></p><p><span><strong>全站私信</strong><br />3月2日00:10:00<br />文案：【礼物上新】基础礼物上新啦~快来看看新礼物和玩法吧~</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span>以上，如有问题，及时沟通～​</span></p>",
